    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28047" root="عثكل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُثْكُولَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِثْكَالٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُثْكُولٌ</span></b> ,
(TA,) (assumed tropical:)  <i>A kind of pendant, of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِهْن</span> [i. e. <i>wool,</i>
or <i>dyed wool</i>], or <i>some</i> [<i>other</i>] <i>ornament,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>suspended to a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هودج</span> [or <i>women's camel-vehicle</i>],
(TA,) <i>so as to dangle in the air:</i> (K, TA:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَاكِلُ</span> occurring in a verse [by poetic license for
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَاكِيلُ</span>]. (TA.)

